#ASSERT `the PRVI Amex loyalty bonus threshold in S$ for a card approved on` (Date 1 9 2025) `in the membership year starting` (Date 1 10 2026) EQUALS 80000
#ASSERT `the PRVI Amex loyalty bonus threshold in S$ for a card approved on` (Date 1 9 2025) `in the membership year starting` (Date 1 9 2026) EQUALS 50000
